{"videoId":"dPmZVlkOU9g","title":"Use Any PC as a Second Monitor on Linux (Hyprland Virtual Display Guide)","author":"Linux Renaissance","authorId":"UCxSiyTe60iQAY1UqCylNMmw","published":1752818433000,"description":"🔥 <b>Basically you use a second PC to act as a second monitor</b>\nLike, comment, and share to support more content!\n\n💾 <b>Download the script here</b>\nhttps://github.com/LinuxRenaissance/VirtMon\n\n📝 <b>Quick Summary of the Video</b>\nI used Hyprland on Arch Linux to create a headless screen which I have attached to a VNC server to which I have connected from a second computer which acted as my external monitor. It&apos;s magic!\n\n👀 <b>Watch my entire MAIN playlist here</b>\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3KVgwMTWoO0wKgJWk3BBtB20okJvu_6q\n\n📍 <b>Timestamps</b>\n00:00 Intro\n03:16 Hands-on\n08:10 Demo\n09:50 Outro\n\n❤️ <b>Help Keep This Content Going</b>\nMemberships: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxSiyTe60iQAY1UqCylNMmw/join\nPatreon: https://patreon.com/LinuxRenaissance\nKo-fi: https://ko-fi.com/darth\nMerch: https://shop.linuxrenaissance.com/\nZorin Pro: https://zorin.com/linuxrenaissance\n\n📢 <b>Join The Linux Renaissance Community</b>\nWebsite: https://linuxrenaissance.com/\nMatrix Room: https://matrix.to/#/%23lr:fosshq.org\n\n🎵 <b>Music By</b>\nH0ffman: https://soundcloud.com/h0ffman/sets/protracker-amiga\n\n🙏 <b>Linux Renaissance is supported by</b>\nOPNsense: https://opnsense.org/\n\nLinks within this video may contain affiliate links that I receive a small commission from.\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#linux</a>","viewCount":3082,"lengthSeconds":666,"watchProgress":16.797706,"timeWatched":1766740614058,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"1NzuXhTBXgCF05mZ","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
