{"videoId":"NmkQK4ur8Hw","title":"Advice! Is it harder to survive on art than to debut?!","author":"그림멘탈선생 시니 SINI42","authorId":"UCnVSBeOu400BBuPw1uNwWlQ","published":1777460406000,"description":"00:00 Start\n\n00:16 I&apos;m afraid I won&apos;t be able to establish myself as an illustrator in the future\n\n03:16 I like many things, but I lack a style or a clear artistic vision\n\n04:03 I only do what I want to do\n\n05:16 Doing what you like vs. doing what you&apos;re good at\n\n06:15 I&apos;ve become afraid of drawing\n\n07:21 I don&apos;t want to get hurt by what others say\n\n08:37 Being really good at drawing isn&apos;t that important\n\n11:52 I want to sell my soul to the devil\n\n12:28 Good motivation to not give up\n\n13:21 Can beginners go to an art academy?\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \n❤️ Coloso Lecture Part 1! Listen to Character Design ▶\n\nhttps://coloso.co.kr/products/conceptartist-soyoong\n\n💙 Coloso Lecture Part 2! Listen to the Freelancer Debut Episode ▶\n\nhttps://coloso.co.kr/products/conceptartist-soyoong2\n\n📚 Study at the Ghost Cafe ▶\n\nhttps://cafe.naver.com/42sini42\n\n😎 View Artwork ▶\n\nhttps://x.com/rr_ronron\n\n😎 Created by: CINY\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawing\">#Drawing</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/illustration\">#Illustration</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/illustrator\">#Illustrator</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chugumi\">#ChuGumi</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artstyle\">#ArtStyle</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/howtodrawwell\">#HowToDrawWell</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/advice\">#Advice</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mentalcounseling\">#MentalCounseling</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artadvice\">#ArtAdvice</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beautifulgirl\">#BeautifulGirl</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/subculture\">#Subculture</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/subcultureillustration\">#SubcultureIllustration</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/subcultureillustrator\">#SubcultureIllustrator</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artmentalteachercini\">#ArtMentalTeacherCini</a>","viewCount":14819,"lengthSeconds":893,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1781334258773,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"2FsH38Z5nPA4hNRG","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"SMKiELjUrlI","title":"🐍 Python programming - video downloader script with yt-dlp","author":"DeAndre Wilson","authorId":"UC-KXFy3ppwtlWxC2BVuj0Hg","published":1767283246000,"description":"I&apos;ve started learning Python a month ago, and in this video, I&apos;d like to demonstrate a simple script i made. It let&apos;s you download media online using yt-dlp. Please note that this video is NOT meant to be a general Python tutorial. More of a showcase.\n\n⌚ TIMESTAMPS\n00:00 Intro\n01:16 the functions \n02:15 has_ytdlp() \n04:28 getting url input \n05:37 select_format() \n12:35 confirm_download() \n14:26 download_video() \n16:45 Conclusion \n\n📒 SHOW NOTES\nSource code - https://github.com/drequeary/python-video-downloader.py\nCS50 Python crash course (FREE) https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eNc5lJfZFM\nCS50 Python full course (FREE) https://cs50.harvard.edu/python/weeks/0/\nVisually Explained - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXJCOLRff74CY5AyjBqswbQ/videos/videos\n\n🙏🏾 CREDITS\n🎵 Music - Slowed My World by DJ Keizer790\n🎞️ Intro/outro video - Vecteezy","viewCount":8973,"lengthSeconds":1074,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1776300676075,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"3dznBc0t9h4aYC4J","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"Tx9dHc0MyHs","title":"Making Linux look Frutiger Aero","author":"diinki","authorId":"UCrk2bNxxxLP-Qd77KxBJ3Xg","published":1740250394000,"description":"In this video I create a Linux Rice from scratch, with the Frutiger Aero aesthetic; one of my favorite aesthetics for desktop and UI design.\n\nI used Arch Linux, Hyprland, and a few other things; more details on the rice and how to install it for yourself can be found here:\nhttps://github.com/diinki/diinki-aero\nYou can also find all the wallpapers there.\n\nIf you are above the age of 18, and want to join our discord, you can do so here: https://discord.gg/gleep !\n\nIf you enjoyed everything, feel free to subscribe and like!\n\nChapters:\n0:00 Intro\n0:37 Video Explanation\n1:21 Frutiger Aero Explained\n3:19 The Taskbar\n5:42 GTK theme &amp; Widgets\n7:23 History of Frutiger Aero\n8:30 Wallpapers\n9:31 Result\n10:16 Outro","viewCount":197989,"lengthSeconds":636,"watchProgress":636.281,"timeWatched":1776235032640,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"3i5HGRwILUMf4ihr","lastViewedPlaylistId":"PLc7BA-Rr97VpmRGUjXfFn6MQm-wAG1cSm","lastViewedPlaylistType":"local","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
