{"videoId":"yKoBrB2dSbw","title":"𝗹𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗻𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁 𝗹𝗼𝗳𝗶","author":"Bloom room","authorId":"UCPvSiWbHTgEgekL3spo7WMg","published":1753366380000,"description":"soothing lo-fi playlist for sleep, focus, and relax. Even in these quiet, restless hours, remember that this feeling won&apos;t last forever. It&apos;s okay to be here in this moment. Your thoughts are valid, and your journey to peace is happening, even if it feels slow. You are stronger than you know, and rest will come when it’s meant to🖤\n. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . \n\nTrack List:\n\n00:00 - wide awake\n03:32 - fading sleep\n06:30 - the long wait\n10:03 - under the still sky\n13:33 - stuck in my head\n16:13 - lost time\n19:43 - no rest\n22:27 - broken sleep \n24:39 - chasing empty\n27:35 - cold night\n31:05 - late night lofi\n\n. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . \n\nart : generated by genAi &amp; edited by Bloom room\nmusic : generated by genAi &amp; mixing and mastering by Bloom room\n. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . \n\nSee you tomorrow🖤\n\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/lofi\">#lofi</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chill\">#chill</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beats\">#beats</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/playlist\">#playlist</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/musicforstudying\">#musicforstudying</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/studylofi\">#studylofi</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/instrumental\">#instrumental</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/lofimixtape\">#lofimixtape</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/insomnia\">#insomnia</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/anxiety\">#anxiety</a>","viewCount":1510033,"lengthSeconds":3730,"watchProgress":0.550429,"timeWatched":1776304423007,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"80DXRJohu1k4UFlG","lastViewedPlaylistId":"RDyKoBrB2dSbw","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
