{"videoId":"4iw8XLusQ7s","title":"I Studied Character Design - Here's (almost) EVERYTHING I know.","author":"Cuora","authorId":"UChSO55vv5UOIsxiRowUxikw","published":1754060621000,"description":"Hope you enjoy my crash course into character design! Cause I didn&apos;t, this took way too long to make.\nFor the past few months, I&apos;ve been studying and analyzing character designs, This is almost EVERYTHING I know about character designing, if you think I missed something, feel free to share, give me more knowledge, I need more to fill my empty head.\nThis is by FAR my longest video, let me know if I should do more longform content like this!\n\nHere&apos;s my playlist of all the character design videos btw if you&apos;re interested:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JJYz76bEBHs&list=PLLcbsZUWWIipyGKQn3lf3DctDB00od_Me&index=1\n\nCheck out Rinotuna&apos;s course on Coloso!\nhttps://coloso.global/en/products/illustrator-rinotuna-us\n\nSocials:\nPixiv: https://www.pixiv.net/en/users/87097018\nTwitter: https://x.com/hydro_mage \nTwitch: https://www.twitch.tv/cu0ra \n\n00:00 Introduction\n00:30 section 1: What is good character design?\n03:24 section 2: Character design direction\n09:13 section 3: Shapes and silhouettes\n15:01 section 4: Color theory\n19:39 section 5: Environment and medium\n24:31 section 6: Eye candy and details\n33:29 section 7: composition/organization\n37:57 My own design process\n41:17 Discussion time\n\nAcid Trumpet af Kevin MacLeod er licenseret under en Creative Commons – tilskrivning 4.0-licens. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/art\">#art</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/animeart\">#animeart</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/howtodraw\">#howtodraw</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/digitalart\">#digitalart</a>","viewCount":475326,"lengthSeconds":2837,"watchProgress":1.408859,"timeWatched":1776304096148,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"BJoD6fA32SU6zB7d