{"videoId":"Z_a61AZyUK8","title":"Let's Discuss Hookup Culture.","author":"Not Even Emily","authorId":"UChhyfYkhuVrzmvDr-WqpDSw","published":1775331008000,"description":"Use my code FAN20 to get your new favorite toy from Lelo!! https://lelo.to/NotEvenEmily \n\ntoday we discuss hookup culture! we touch on the third wave feminism, women taking their pleasure into their own hands, the insecurities / pressures of hookup culture, and silly observations. hope you enjoyyyy xxx\n\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ \n\n⟡ SUBSCRIBE ⟡\nhttp://bit.ly/SubNotEvenEmily\n\n⟡ My Latest Short Film ⟡\nMore Dead Than Living ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X-dKdyC_ojQ\n\n⟡ Watch these videos ⟡ \nThe Franchise Actor Curse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYI_X-jzsVU&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\n\nReacting to Your Dating Horror Stories ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o9jfJnHnL7I\n\nThis App is like Facebook but Worse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RbkT9o886PA\n\nRoblox Horror Games Have Pushed Me to the Edge ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=epK2UsV8VkI\n\nIt&apos;s Time for a Change. ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UidLBnncfds\n\n⟡ Connect with me ⟡\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/stillnotemily/\nTikTok: not.even.emily\n\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀","viewCount":314886,"lengthSeconds":2729,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1776300383404,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"M1Esu1k3bmLlQgYM","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"BBZkMoAcI-M","title":"Our first collaboration!!! A former game art director shares his thoughts on the company and free...","author":"그림멘탈선생 시니 SINI42","authorId":"UCnVSBeOu400BBuPw1uNwWlQ","published":1713956406000,"description":"I&apos;ve finally done an interview broadcast alongside my long-awaited collaboration with Noy Sensei!!! Be sure to listen, because I&apos;ll be sharing some really great information. It&apos;s so informative!!\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawingtips\">#DrawingTips</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawinglearning\">#DrawingLearning</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mentalhealth\">#MentalHealth</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawingstudy\">#DrawingStudy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/art\">#art</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/krvtuber\">#krvtuber</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawingmentalhealth\">#DrawingMentalHealth</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gamecompany\">#GameCompany</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artdirector\">#ArtDirector</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ad\">#AD</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/companystory\">#CompanyStory</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gamecompanystory\">#GameCompanyStory</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/illustration\">#Illustration</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/characterdesign\">#CharacterDesign</a>\n\nEdited by: Iris♥♥♥♥\nThumbnail: Me and the Ghost♥♥♥♥","viewCount":25443,"lengthSeconds":1633,"watchProgress":16.494686,"timeWatched":1781290028214,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"MF1tdtUL8AZTLtii","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"hSTy_BInQs8","title":"Obsidian: The King of Learning Tools (FULL GUIDE + SETUP)","author":"Odysseas","authorId":"UCQjBsscIa_mgEnSvWpm_9vw","published":1713952843000,"description":"Obsidian has been the centerpiece of my self-education for 10 months now, proving itself as the perfect outlet for my reading, writing and thinking.\n\nBy combining mini-essays with the Zettelkasten system, I&apos;ve created a workflow which fits my learning like a glove, and I hope it&apos;ll work the same for you.\n\nHere, notes go beyond mere online post-it notes.\n\nThey&apos;re opportunities to learn, to practice writing, to store big ideas and to serve your future projects in any creative endeavor you love.\n\nFollow up video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IMfz9E7g-Hk\n\nSubscribe to my Newsletter:\nhttps://odysseas.ck.page/509a9315a4\n\nDownload Obsidian:\nhttps://obsidian.md/\n\nAtomic vs Literature Notes Video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_t9R1AnB7ho\n\nMini-Essays Video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N4YjXJVzoZY\n\nFor more Obsidian (some of the resources that helped me set up my own):\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E6ySG7xYgjY\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gXvozu3I4K0&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wvAZ9-hmWQU\n\nTry Audionotes for free with https://audionotes.app/?aff=7wjen\n\n\n00:00-00:16 Intro \n00:16-2:23 Avoiding Toxic Perfectionism \n2:23-2:53 My Testimony \n2:53-4:22 The Zettelkasten \n4:22-5:12 The Value of Being Slow \n5:12-6:25 Instant Feedback \n6:25-9:14 Perfect Idea Storage \n9:14-10:22 The Power to Remix Ideas \n10:22-14:00 Your Personal Writing Assistant \n14:00-20:34 Folder Setup + How to Tag \n20:34-22:30 Important Settings \n22:30-24:03 Note Template \n24:03-24:58 Creating a New Note \n24:58-35:38 Writing a Note (Start-to-Finish) \n35:38-36:26 Ask Me Anything","viewCount":2940925,"lengthSeconds":2186,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1779315416701,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"OEl1agz80v00IjII","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"H7RQYREJO98","title":"What your Linux Distro says about You","author":"diinki","authorId":"UCrk2bNxxxLP-Qd77KxBJ3Xg","published":1730921288000,"description":"I use my psychic abilities in order to deduce what your Linux distro of choice says about you; in this video... I also make somewhat of a tierlist in this one so there&apos;s that :p\n\nJoin our club, if you&apos;re 18:\nhttps://discord.gg/nCBwjHzP6e\n\nChapters:\n\n0:00 Intro\n0:30 Ubuntu\n1:03 Pop!_OS\n1:42 Debian\n1:48 Mint\n2:20 Redhat Linux\n3:09 Deepin\n3:52 Kali Linux\n4:36 EndeavorOS\n5:24 Gentoo\n6:04 Arch Linux\n6:16 NixOS\n6:54 Manjaro\n7:19 Elementary OS\n7:59 Fedora Linux\n8:28 Results &amp; Goodbyes\n\nThank you for watching :)","viewCount":217549,"lengthSeconds":568,"watchProgress":294.218526,"timeWatched":1776236778788,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"QTenFm1QkuLr7D21","lastViewedPlaylistId":"PLc7BA-Rr97VpmRGUjXfFn6MQm-wAG1cSm","lastViewedPlaylistType":"local","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"tVynETvms-o","title":"Tips for Drawing Backgrounds!","author":"BaM Animation","authorId":"UC4Qvpti1dS1KKC7PLyLl__g","published":1662469238000,"description":"Backgrounds are Important for storytelling! But no one seems to want to draw them! In this Episode, Brent and Max draw backgrounds for characters that YOU summited, we talk about perspective, composition, and staging and all other tips related to animation background design <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/animation\">#animation</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/backgroundart\">#backgroundart</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/perspective\">#perspective</a> \n\nPerspective Video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=upxBGNcryRs\nBackground Template : https://www.dropbox.com/s/quqe6ehf5qsj88g/BAM_BackgroundTemplate_V1_XX.psd?dl=0\nDisney Comic Guide : https://comicsalliance.com/disney-comic-strip-artists-kit/\n00:00 Intro \n1:25 Thinking about Backgrounds\n2:51 Simple Background exercise\n4:09 Animation Background Size\n4:46 Donut Shop Background\n7:14 Playing with Shapes\n8:25 Fantasy village Background\n10:08  Alien Planet Background\n10:24 Disney Manual for drawing Comics\n11:50 Tangents\n12:36 Outro\n------------------------------------\n👍🏻Patreon https://www.patreon.com/BamAnimation\n🎧Discord https://discord.gg/Cjf4Tdy\n📺Second Channel https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMO0IVUke1WB3cffqL1RggA\n------------------------------------\nBaM is dedicated to teaching artists all about the animation industry, and skills sets including character design, background design, animation, and painting!  Send us your art,  and BaM will make an episode about YOU!\n\nEmail Bam.redrawmyart@gmail.com\nIf you want to have YOUR art redrawn!\n\n✏We have a Website and Store now!✏\nhttps://www.brentandmax.com/\n\nVisit our Portfolios\nhttps://portfolio-maximus.tumblr.com/\nhttps://brentnoll.com/\n\nInstagram\nhttps://www.instagram.com/bam_animation/","viewCount":1419136,"lengthSeconds":885,"watchProgress":0.079442,"timeWatched":1776323432890,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"QVrlPW5IGfwvYSFY","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"wu2NWw2wPaA","title":"How To Use Multiple Monitors On Linux (With Xrandr)","author":"Brodie Robertson","authorId":"UCld68syR8Wi-GY_n4CaoJGA","published":1573246806000,"description":"I know that a lot of people like to use a dual or even triple monitor setup, but when you use a window manager it doesn&apos;t magically work like with a desktop environment. So today we&apos;re going to take a look at how to use Xrandr to configure dual monitor support on Linux, this should work for any system that uses an X Server but I&apos;m sure that Wayland has an equivalent tool.\n\n► $100 Linode Credit: https://linode.gvw92c.net/BrodieRobertson\n\n💖 Subscribe and ding the bell for more videos! \n👍 Leave a like if you got something out of this video!\n✍ Comment some video feedback or what you want to see next time!\n\nXrandr on Arch Linux Wiki:\nhttps://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php/Xrandr\n\nFix Intel Driver Colour Bug:\nhttps://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php/Intel_graphics#Weathered_colors_(color_range_problems)\n\n🖥️ GitHub:\nhttps://github.com/BrodieRobertson\n\n🐦 Twitter:\nhttps://twitter.com/BrodieOnYoutube\n\n🌐 Mastodon:\nhttps://mastodon.social/@BrodieOnYoutube\n\n🎵 Opening music\nMusic from https://filmmusic.io/\n&quot;Rocket&quot; by Kevin MacLeod (https://incompetech.com/)\nLicense: CC BY (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)\n\n🎵 Ending music\nMusic from https://filmmusic.io/\n&quot;Basic Implosion&quot; by Kevin MacLeod (https://incompetech.com/)\nLicense: CC BY (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)\n\nDISCLOSURE: Wherever possible I use referral links, which means if you click one of the links in this video or description and make a purchase we may receive a small commission or other compensation.","viewCount":143197,"lengthSeconds":840,"watchProgress":28.58266,"timeWatched":1766553643790,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"SSKCiY36syTiWRyj","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
