{"videoId":"cXFKrIUbXc4","title":"How I Practice Drawing BACKGROUNDS | Aliya Chen Artist Study","author":"Sariya","authorId":"UCnHpUqzz15rtU6qBfiGWrrA","published":1763049734000,"description":"All Artists&apos; work is credited in the bottom right of the screen and linked in the description!!! Works with no credit are my own.\n\nIn this video, I walk you through how I practiced drawing backgrounds. The system I used helped me get results extremely quickly, but it wasn&apos;t easy. Prepare Yourself! \nI hope this video helped you! As always, I&apos;m happy to hear any feedback or suggestions.\n\nIllustration on Thumbnail:\n🎨Aliya Chen: https://x.com/chenalii\n\nArtists Mentioned:\n🎨Aliya Chen: https://x.com/chenalii\n🎨Dao Trong Le: instagram.com/daotrongle/\n🎨Kan Liu: instagram.com/artof666k\n🎨Airi Pan: instagram.com/pix_bun/\n🎨Guweiz: instagram.com/guweiz/\n🎨Ozyako: (Couldn&apos;t find any socials)\n🎨Timbougami: instagram.com/timbougami/\n🎨ac2971: https://x.com/ac2971\n🎨Felicia Chen: instagram.com/77felchen/\n🎨Pikat: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpJU5mN3mv6VJCDb-1k7PAA\n\nMusic by Louie Zong \nhttps://louiezong.bandcamp.com/\nand YouTube&apos;s free Audio library\n\nResources: \nDrawabox: https://drawabox.com/\nThumbnails/Composition: \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2NbGy2cMEFg\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l8cVJIJTrkU\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OLX6uXuAdP8\n\nIf you like my art, follow me on my Instagram:\nInstagram:  https://www.instagram.com/sariyaart/\n\nBusiness Email: sariyadesign@gmail.com\n\nChapters:\n00:00 Introduction\n00:40 It&apos;s &quot;Environment&quot;\n01:50 Perspective\n03:30 Composition\n05:45 Designing\n07:19 Application\n08:59 Conclusion\n\nThank you for watching!","viewCount":140597,"lengthSeconds":594,"watchProgress":146.621896,"timeWatched":1776590661083,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"cgXhm4bHlq1r0Kvg","lastViewedPlaylistId":"watchLater","lastViewedPlaylistType":"user","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":"f2ff077a-c916-4186-8a67-