{"videoId":"vo81Svo5RnI","title":"Playing All The Roblox Games You COMMANDED Me To Play...","author":"Not Even Emily","authorId":"UChhyfYkhuVrzmvDr-WqpDSw","published":1749929420000,"description":"Come see me and Jake do a live podcast w/ Spotify at VidCon on June 20th!! Wahooo!!! (Follow me on instagram @ stillnotemily to stay updated!)\n\nI asked you guys to demand me to play different Roblox games. This is the result of that. xoxo\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ \n\n⟡ SUBSCRIBE ⟡\nhttp://bit.ly/SubNotEvenEmily\n\n⟡ Watch these videos ⟡ \n\nThe Franchise Actor Curse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYI_X-jzsVU\n\nReacting to Your Dating Horror Stories ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o9jfJnHnL7I\n\nThis App is like Facebook but Worse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RbkT9o886PA\n\nRoblox Horror Games Have Pushed Me to the Edge ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=epK2UsV8VkI\n\nIt&apos;s Time for a Change. ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UidLBnncfds\n\n⟡ Connect with me ⟡\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/stillnotemily/\nTikTok: not.even.emily\n\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀","viewCount":275507,"lengthSeconds":2954,"watchProgress":2953.881,"timeWatched":1781177461437,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"eHcPEClZTut7R8nH","lastViewedPlaylistId":"PLrdy88AAN3FfFdFz9xSSWXtnWl5F151os","lastViewedPlaylistType":"local","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"RD1nyWmuygo","title":"I completed the CGSPEAK course and I have something to say.","author":"Лера Руки-Пэнселы","authorId":"UC8PWwXCzxTI9M4czD8dWnVw","published":1772025830000,"description":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artist\">#artist</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/art\">#art</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawing\">#drawing</a>\n\nYou&apos;re probably familiar with the CGSPEAK channel, and perhaps it&apos;s thanks to him that you started your drawing journey. As did I.\n\nIn 2023, I purchased his signature course on social media promotion. I had no doubts about his expertise—after all, he&apos;s Uncle Lesha, who&apos;ll explain and tell you everything. But the reality turned out to be completely different from what I expected...\n\nI highly recommend pausing the video when the screenshots are shown on the screen. Some of the victims shared their experiences in text format.\n\nIMPORTANT LINKS:\nRead the conversation with the CGSpeaks manager in the comments to this post: https://t.me/pencilhand/2408\n(If I clean it up, I&apos;ll post screenshots in a separate post)\n\nFor all complaints or questions, please contact us here: https://t.me/cgspeaks/4305\n(The CGSpeaks manager promised to personally resolve all issues with everyone)\n\nRoman Akhmedov, practicing lawyer - @takgovoritroman\n\nBLOP artist (the girl Alexey didn&apos;t pay half for a joint master class): https://t.me/blopvalera\n\nMasha, author of the comic &quot;I Hate My Powerlessness&quot;: https://t.me/alliswr\n\nREAD MY COMIC &quot;HAND IN HAND WITH DESPAIR&quot;\n\n⭐️ Mangalib - https://mangalib.me/ru/manga/215805--pod-ruku-s-otcayanem?section=comments&ui=9729077\n⭐️ Telegram channel - https://t.me/prsocomic\n⭐️ CRE8 - https://www.create8.ru/comics/782/\n\nMY SOCIAL NETWORKS\n\n🌑 Telegram channel - https://t.me/pencilhand\n🌑 Support the channel - https://boosty.to/leyrel \n🌑 Telegram channel with useful tips for artists - https://t.me/artpencilhand\n\nTIMESTAMPS:\n00:00 - Introduction\n01:13 - My story\n05:52 - Legal advice\n10:10 - Why did this video even come out?\n10:40 - There was a scandal on this topic before, but it was hushed up + analysis of the official response CGSpeak\n1:26 PM - A CGSpeak manager came to my TGC\n3:23 PM - Victim Stories (Course Purchase)\n7:48 PM - Review by Masha (author of &quot;I Hate My Powerlessness&quot;) about her experience taking the course\n11:54 PM - Artist BLOP collaborated with CGSpeak to create a master class this summer, and she&apos;s still waiting for part of the money.\n3:07 PM - A victim bought production from CGSpeak for 65,000 rubles, and they didn&apos;t even leave him with the lessons\n4:05 PM - Results\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/cgspeak\">#cgspeak</a>","viewCount":147382,"lengthSeconds":2555,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1776222590177,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"eMazStxo2PUQNuDC","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
