{"videoId":"isgWa12I-3M","title":"Art Commission Explained (From An Illustrator Who Went Broke from Commissions)","author":"그림멘탈선생 시니 SINI42","authorId":"UCnVSBeOu400BBuPw1uNwWlQ","published":1727262006000,"description":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/commission\">#Commission</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/illustration\">#Illustration</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/art\">#Art</a>  \n\nI want to receive commissions! But I don’t understand why people request commissions. What exactly is a commission? How is it different from outsourcing? There are so many terms I don’t know! Let’s take a step-by-step look at commissions together~!!\n\n<b>*Please note that this explanation is based on the Korean commission market*</b>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawingtips\">#DrawingTips</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawingtutorial\">#DrawingTutorial</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artstudy\">#ArtStudy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/art\">#Art</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artrequest\">#ArtRequest</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/illustration\">#Illustration</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/commission\">#Commission</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/artcommission\">#ArtCommission</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/digitalartcommission\">#DigitalArtCommission</a>","viewCount":255682,"lengthSeconds":1096,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1781290066906,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"jszZMQ2mhxflGZRc","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"NKSvtj9eAj0","title":"Phainon Theme Music EXTENDED - Coronal Radiance (tnbee mix) ft. ‪@Bodokun‬  | Honkai: Star Rail","author":"tnbee","authorId":"UCwwz34or0IhJMzqEfJBfBkQ","published":1751341074000,"description":"This OST played on Phainon Trailer — &quot;Coronal Radiance&quot; | Honkai: Star Rail\n\nPlay Honkai: Star Rail now! https://hoyo.link/XxqngVet5\n\nThank you https://www.youtube.com/@Bodokun for singing on my channel!!\nThis trailer is absolute cinema... The music, the animation, the story... Everything is just perfect. I absolutely had a blast while making this cover!! I will be having Phainon on day 1. \nI hope you guys enjoy my version! Use headphones for the best experience!\n\nSupport me on Patreon! Download all of my works in high quality! https://www.patreon.com/tnbee\nSubscribe so I can continue making more music! Thank you very much!\n\nCoronal Radiance (tnbee mix)\nComposer: HOYO-MiX\nSinger: https://www.youtube.com/@Bodokun \nArranger &amp; Producer: tnbee\nAll copyright belongs to their respective owners.\n\nYou can also find me here:\n➤ Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/0cJKVhrPAsTbiwKervvVQH?si=Fqx0RZ34T7OvCpE6oMEdCg\n➤ Apple Music: https://music.apple.com/id/artist/tnbee/1558312259\n➤ Twitter: https://twitter.com/tnbeeat\n\nSupport me on Ko-fi:\n➤ https://ko-fi.com/tnbee\n\nRepost of my cover anywhere else is strictly prohibited (extending my cover, re-upload, etc).\nHowever, you can use all of my mix for stream or bgm for your content, just leaves the credit! \n\nOriginal Trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GaT1GftoqV0\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/honkaistarrail\">#HonkaiStarRail</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/phainon\">#Phainon</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/tnbeemix\">#tnbeemix</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/hoyocreators\">#hoyocreators</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/hsrcreators\">#hsrcreators</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/