{"videoId":"dgq2P9GC_Xg","title":"The \"Hot Girl & Ugly Guy\" Combo","author":"Not Even Emily","authorId":"UChhyfYkhuVrzmvDr-WqpDSw","published":1780774238000,"description":"If you want to browse smarter, get Opera today! https://opr.as/Opera-browser-notevenemily\n\ntoday we talk about the &quot;hot girl &amp; ugly guy&quot; combo, a duo that has caught the attention of the general public for quite some time now. we talk about disparities in physical attractiveness in romantic relationships and why people care to comment on it. regardless... love is love... regardless of face card. \n\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ \n\n⟡ SUBSCRIBE ⟡\nhttp://bit.ly/SubNotEvenEmily\n\n⟡ My Latest Short Film ⟡\nMore Dead Than Living ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X-dKdyC_ojQ\n\n⟡ Watch these videos ⟡ \nThe Franchise Actor Curse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYI_X-jzsVU\n\nReacting to Your Dating Horror Stories ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o9jfJnHnL7I\n\nThis App is like Facebook but Worse ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RbkT9o886PA\n\nRoblox Horror Games Have Pushed Me to the Edge ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=epK2UsV8VkI\n\nIt&apos;s Time for a Change. ➜ https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UidLBnncfds\n\n⟡ Connect with me ⟡\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/stillnotemily/\nTikTok: not.even.emily\n\n❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀ ❀","viewCount":277960,"lengthSeconds":2245,"watchProgress":2244.641,"timeWatched":1781255201927,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"lITmGk6wrxCBVVAC","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
