{"videoId":"dkX9Ul6kywM","title":"I Made Myself Draw Backgrounds Every Day for a Week","author":"Drawfee Show","authorId":"UCoal_hpPIPAnWlG-kWHLheA","published":1686848420000,"description":"In this episode, Jacob challenges himself to overcome his fear of backgrounds by drawing one every day for a whole week!\n\nSUPPORT US ON PATREON!\nhttps://www.patreon.com/drawfee\n\nWATCH US ON TWITCH!\nhttps://www.twitch.tv/drawfeeshow\n\nAND ON TIKTOK!\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@drawfeeshow\n\nVISIT THE DRAWFEE STORE!\nhttps://bit.ly/3aWPCmG\n\nFOLLOW US ON TWITTER!\nhttps://twitter.com/DrawfeeShow\nhttps://twitter.com/AtNathanYaffe\nhttps://twitter.com/JuliaLepetit\nhttps://twitter.com/FLoaBComic\nhttps://twitter.com/dilfosaur\nhttps://twitter.com/DavidClarkie\n\nYour comments here may be used as inspiration for our future shows! By commenting here with an episode prompt, you acknowledge that we may use and reproduce your handle and suggestions on our programs.","viewCount":441400,"lengthSeconds":1536,"watchProgress":1.664621,"timeWatched":1776323503909,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"p1QrXW0tIli0ohFm","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"LnsB8ghXM5g","title":"Phainon's Song 2 (Music so you never give up) 1hr loop from the hero within | Honkai Star Rail 3.4","author":"CroffeeBreak","authorId":"UCmsA7JeS0W5hc9pp5WxHG6w","published":1752116461000,"description":"He pushed the boulder up the mountain only for it to fall over and over again... yet he started over each time... each cycle being heavier than before, as the weight of his burden grew more and more. He had no choice but to get stronger and to surpass his own limits, because of a wish he wanted more than existence itself... Little did he know, to become the dawn is to burn. And burn himself he did, he would burn eternally if he has to.\n\n(This is how I feel when I listen to this version of the song. It&apos;s a song to fight fate and to never give up.)\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/phainon\">#phainon</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/honkaistarrail\">#honkaistarrail</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/phainonhsr\">#phainonhsr</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/amphoreus\">#amphoreus</a>","viewCount":212360,"lengthSeconds":3740,"watchProgress":1311.333095,"timeWatched":1781170757384,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"pSEYVV9s1vvSt520","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
