{"videoId":"4WBkosIUBKA","title":"HOW TO DRAW LIKE ASIANS? Drawing techniques 1.","author":"CG Speak","authorId":"UCDUJu_bQH68A4FXij5P_8MQ","published":1585302545000,"description":"3D ARTIST PROFESSION: \nGood afternoon, friends! Today we&apos;ll be exploring the most enjoyable part of drawing – techniques. Or, more simply, how to draw like an Asian.\nAnd our first lesson will be on the Asian drawing style.\n\nOther drawing tutorials:\nHow to draw a face: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hAHiaJF3GE\nHow to draw hair: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QkgW8dV-XkM\nHow to draw hands: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=140a2ahTnaI\nHow to draw a mouth and lips: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9qDN8n2svY\n\n—————————————————————\nFor collaboration inquiries: \ncgspeak@yandex.ru\n—————————————————————\n\nP.S. Don&apos;t forget that channel activity depends on likes and comments! So if you want to help us, you know what to do ;)\n\nHello! If you&apos;re new to our channel, let&apos;s get acquainted.\nWe are the CGSpeak channel, two enthusiasts – Alisa and Alexey. We publish drawing lessons\nfor beginners, as well as materials on learning to draw. If you&apos;re just starting to learn digital graphics\nand are taking your first steps in CG and are interested in Photoshop for beginners, then sit back and watch the videos.\nWe have tons of materials on drawing on a tablet, and we&apos;ll tell you everything about drawing in Photoshop. Forget\nabout online drawing lessons and don&apos;t ask the question &quot;how to learn to draw?&quot; – you can find all the materials you need for free here.\nWe also publish lessons on 3D and animation. It doesn&apos;t matter whether you use Krita, SAI, or Illustrator.\n2D artist. CG Sketches &amp; Art\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/cgspeak\">#cgspeak</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawing\">#drawing</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/drawing_techniques\">#drawing_techniques</a>","viewCount":456805,"lengthSeconds":630,"watchProgress":0.676459,"timeWatched":1776225393209,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"rELL0DOyr3tupgiO","lastViewedPlaylistId":"ft-playlist--c00f6e09-3a78-43c0-866a-a35a493dafd5","lastViewedPlaylistType":"user","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":"19ff20ef-bbf9-438b-ab0b-8e7ebcc5105b"}
