{"videoId":"2QjzI5dXwDY","title":"How to Install NixOS From Scratch (2026 Edition) | Flakes + Home Manager Full Guide","author":"tony","authorId":"UC65_CVnMw6hvPET_DRDg3GA","published":1757113209000,"description":"This is a quick and painless tutorial on how to install and configure NixOS from Scratch. It involves starting off with Home manager and Flakes before even rebuilding your system. This can be seen as a part 4 of the general NixOS series, but it is also very much a standalone episode.\n\n<b>Written Guide:</b> https://www.tonybtw.com/tutorial/nixos-from-scratch/\n<b>Git Repo:</b> https://github.com/tonybanters/nixos-from-scratch\n<b>Donate:</b> https://ko-fi.com/tonybtw\n<b>Discord:</b> https://discord.gg/5w54SuE26V\n\n\n<b>Music:</b>\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RPrgNFnbAhQ\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jy7FMagiTFk\n\n\nChapters\n0:00 Intro\n0:40 Download and Boot into ISO\n1:25 Partition Disks \n2:32 Make and Mount File Systems\n3:39 Generate NixOS Config Files\n4:11 Create Flake and Home files\n5:20 Create flake.nix file\n8:30 Clean up configuration.nix\n10:11 Setup Xserver\n12:20 Nerd Font and Experimental Features\n13:13 Baseline Minimal home.nix file\n14:16 Install NixOS with Flake :)\n15:44 First Boot Into System\n16:49 Create Dotfiles Folder\n18:05 Add Neovim and Qtile configs\n19:23 Install Configs with Home Manager\n20:51 Implement mkOutOfStoreSymLink\n23:52 Clean Up Home.nix variables\n26:22 Further Cleanup with mapAttrs\n29:13 Obligatory Neofetch\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#linux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/nixos\">#nixos</a>","viewCount":87265,"lengthSeconds":1763,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1782989418376,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"8WKKCHHw4l3vpWIl"}
